msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Did you know Gelateria Kamuro over on Taihei Boulevard is often packed with "
"businessmen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"Oh, really? Huh... I'm not that into desserts, though. I like drinking "
"better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "436"
msgid "I drink like, all day when I get a day off, hehehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"I heard the famous actor Noboru Kudarizaka sometimes visits Sushi Gin on "
"Showa Street, incognito."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Oh, really? Guess even celebrities like to eat there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Not interested?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"I mean, not really. I go there to eat sometimes, that's pretty much it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Ever heard of Kanrai over on Shichifuku Street? Well, their kimchi is "
"supposed to be made with authentic Korean pepper. It's apparently good for "
"you, due to the... something-cin?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Capsaicin, right? I heard it like, helps you lose weight and stuff, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Yeah, that's right."
msgstr "Sì, esatto."

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"I also heard that real Korean kimchi is packed with lactic acid, which makes"
" it, like, super good for your skin. Kanrai's kimchi could do the trick. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Maybe I'll go eat there next time I go out for dinner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"I heard the ramen over at Kyushu No. 1 Star over on Pink Street is full of "
"collagen... Ladies like that, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Oooh, I've never had it. Is it good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Yeah, I go there pretty often."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Huh. Maybe I'll go there next time I like, eat out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"You know the Yoshida Batting Center? Pro baseball players go there to "
"practice sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Uh, I've never been to a batting center, and I really don't care about "
"baseball."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Sorry. I know you like, went out of your way to tell me and everything, but "
"yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"You heard about the Matcha Fair that Café Alps is having? It's that little "
"place over on Nakamichi Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"Is that that place that sells Japanese sweets? I'm like, way more into "
"drinking instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"Like, could you talk to me about drinking stuff instead? That's way more "
"interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Have you eaten the braised pork burger over at Smile Burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Braised pork burger? What's that supposed to be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Simple. They just put braised pork between two buns. Apparently, some idol "
"went and blogged about it, and now it's super popular."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"Oh, huh. Blogs sure have a lot of sway over what gets popular nowadays."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Maybe I'll give it a try next time I go out for lunch or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"I heard you can make bag reservations at Le Marche over on Showa Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Ooooh... I've gotta hold back on that right now, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Uh, I'm saving money to study abroad for my belly dancing, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"That's my number one priority right now. That's the whole reason I'm busting"
" my butt, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard of Tantakatan? It's a kind of shochu made with red "
"perilla."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Uh, yeah, I know about Tantakatan. It's super\r\n"
"good. <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Oh, yeah?"
msgstr "Ah, sì?"

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Ugh, it's sooo good when you mix it with cranberry juice. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I could drink it all night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"It's like, so smooth on your throat... I always end up drinking waaaay too "
"much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"Next time you're in Okinawa, try out the Okinawan Soba place at the "
"Kariyushi Arcade. Their rafute soba's supposed to be the best on the island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "Rafute? You mean, like, braised pork?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"There was actually this thing on TV about it. Because rafute loses all its "
"excess fat, the soup gets super packed with nutrients, which makes it really"
" good for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Oh, I'm surprised you knew about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Hehehe... I'm pretty good at like, random trivia, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard of a bar called Aqua Sky? It's all the way in Okinawa, "
"over at Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Hmm... Nope, never heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid ""
"Apparently, there's a really popular appetizer there. Can you guess what "
"that might be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"Uh... I mean, it's Okinawa, so it's probably like, that special tofu they "
"have over there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "Actually, it's salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Wait... it's just salt? Like, table salt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"No, not just any old salt, but an especially rare one made only in Okinawa. "
"Not only is it salty, but it also has a sweetness to it... Helps bring out "
"the flavor of your drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid ""
"Huh... Drinking with a side of salt... That sounds like a super mature thing"
" to do, huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "You should try it out sometime. I think you'd like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "Did you end up going to Gelateria Kamuro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Uh, no... Didn't I tell that I'm not super into desserts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "Oh, right..."
msgstr "Ah, giusto..."

msgctxt "1084"
msgid ""
"What's that supposed to mean? What, were you not like, listening to me or "
"something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "You been to Sushi Gin on Showa Street yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I've been there for sushi and stuff, but I don't really care about the"
" whole celebrity thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "So there's this kimchi at Kanrai..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah! I went with one of the other girls here, and we had some. It "
"tasted, like, super rich... It was sooo good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "Isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid ""
"Plus, it goes super well with alcohol, so we ended up eating and drinking "
"waaaay too much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid ""
"So if I gain like, any weight because of it, it's gonna be your fault, "
"Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "Have you gone to Kyushu No. 1 Star yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "Ugh, I couldn't stand the smell of the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "If you can get past that, the food is incredible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I just can't do it. I don't care how good the food is, I'm gonna throw"
" up just from that smell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "The smell of the tonkotsu is really good, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid "Have you been by the Yoshida Batting Center by any chance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid ""
"Didn't I tell you that I don't know like, anything about baseball players?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "Oh... right."
msgstr "Oh... Giusto."

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "So about the Matcha Fair over at Café Alps..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"Uh, I think you told me about that before. Didn't I tell you liked drinking "
"at a bar way more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "Oh, right..."
msgstr "Ah, giusto..."

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "Did you end up trying the braised pork burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I got one with one of the girls here. It was actually like, good. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "Maybe I'll write about it on my blog, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "Le Marche has this reservation system..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "No! I told you, I have to save up for my study abroad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "Did you try Tantakatan yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid ""
"Uh, yeah? I mean, I drink it here at the club, and at home, too. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "That often?"
msgstr "Spesso così?"

msgctxt "1432"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I dunno what it is, but I like, never get hungover when I drink it. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid ""
"And I always order it when we go out partying, but it goes like, super fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid ""
"Good booze, good friends, that's what life's all about, right? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "So. Let's talk rafute soba..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah! After you brought it up, I decided that I just, like, had to have "
"some, so I went to the Okinawan restaurant near my place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid ""
"Ugh, the rafute was sooo good! I gotta go get the real thing in Okinawa, "
"though!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "You know that legendary appetizer I mentioned?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid "Yeah, you told me about it before. It's like, Okinawan salt, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1528"
msgid ""
"You can't get any around here, though. Hey, you should totally buy me some "
"the next time you're in Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

